<title>POLAND: POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 383 MLN NBP-BILLS.</title>
<headline>POLISH BANKS BID FOR PLN 383 MLN NBP-BILLS.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish banks bid for 383 million zlotys of 273-day NBP-bills against the central bank's 300 million zloty offer, the National Bank of Poland said.</p>
<p>Full details of the auction should be available at about 1300 local time.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
